\f[NSR]\s[8]+2
.L 129.70 59.20
\f[NSI]\s[8]Art of Invisibility
.L 142.70 39.47
\f[NSR]\s[8]+1
.L 142.70 59.20
\f[NSI]\s[8]Attack (Claws)
.L 155.70 39.47
\f[NSR]\s[8]+2
.L 155.70 59.20
\f[NSI]\s[8]Dexterous
.L 168.70 39.47
\f[NSR]\s[8]+2
.L 168.70 59.20
\f[NSI]\s[8]Quick
.L 116.70 220.66
\f[NSR]\s[8]−2
.L 116.70 240.30
\f[NSI]\s[8]Greedy
.L 129.70 220.66
\f[NSR]\s[8]−2
.L 129.70 240.30
\f[NSI]\s[8]Sensitivity (Being Called a Cat)
.L 142.70 220.66
\f[NSR]\s[8]−3
.L 142.70 240.30
\f[NSI]\s[8]Wanted (GPL)
.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Wanted across the galaxy, the **Cat Burglar** will
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]gladly stroll off with your valuables, her feline alien
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]heritage making her nimble and stealthy. Just
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]never call her a cat to her face, or you could lose
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]more than your belongings.
